    "detailed_description": "Lose yourself in Asyle's open world environment to catalogue and tame wondrous creatures called Zoa. Explore the world and go off beaten paths into treacherous landscapes, and with the help of a team of Zoa you've befriended along the way, document the wildlife and uncover the nature of the mysterious catastrophic storms. <br><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2830730/extras/4b25ac3812b65b4b791c72eacd7e1d8b.poster.avif?t=1707536632\" width=640 height=360 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2830730/extras/4b25ac3812b65b4b791c72eacd7e1d8b.webm?t=1707536632\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2830730/extras/4b25ac3812b65b4b791c72eacd7e1d8b.mp4?t=1707536632\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span><br><br><strong>Explore </strong>the myriad environments teeming with life. Climb, Jump, and with the help of your Zoa, bash your way to new places to discover. <br><strong>Quell </strong>the feral instincts of nature and form powerful bonds to overcome the challenges and combatants along your journey.<br><strong>Catalogue </strong>mysterious uncharted places, and the beings that populate them using your camera to document events few may ever see.",
